    "author" : [ "Tarmo Robal" ],
    "description" : {
      "en" : "MODULE: IDENT\nIdentifier module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.\n\nThe Identifier module proposes an universal approach for identifiers used in the EU DPP CO delivered by the CIRPASS-2 European Project.  \nThe module describes identifiers used for the project through aspects and scheme references, if appropriate, granularity is added.\n---\n\nDESIGN RESTRICTION: Specific modules of the EU DPP CO need to use the Connector to establish a link to the Identifiers module. The link needs to be establsihed to a subclass of aIdentifier class, e.g., Product hasUniqueProductIdentifier ProductIdentifier.\n---\n\nDEPENDENCIES: This module may have dependencies to all  EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules that use different types of identifiers, including: CON, P_DPP, SOC, ACTOR, ...  \n--\n\nTHIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. \nAll liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user."
    },
