      "comment" : {
        "en" : "According to ESPR Art 9 (2d) the digital product passport is to be established at model, batch or item level, and the definition of such levels is given by delegated acts;\n\nThe term ‘model’ usually refers to a version of a product of which all units share the same technical characteristics relevant for the ecodesign requirements and the same model identifier (ESPR preamble (33))."
      },
      "labels" : {
        "IRI-based" : "model",
        "en" : "model"
      }
    }, {
      "iri" : "https://w3id.org/eudpp#item",
