      "comment" : {
        "en" : "According to ESPR Art 9 (2d) the digital product passport is to be established at model, batch or item level, and the definition of such levels is given by delegated acts;\n\nThe term ‘item’ usually refers to a single unit of a model (ESPR preamble (33))."
      },
      "labels" : {
        "IRI-based" : "item",
        "en" : "item"
      }
    } ],
